No license has been chosen yet, so this file is a placeholder that exists only
to hold the slot in the project layout. Until real terms are written here,
default copyright law applies: the work is "all rights reserved" and nobody
else has permission to use, copy, modify or distribute it.

Common choices for academic/research code:

  - MIT          permissive, very short, requires attribution
  - BSD-3-Clause permissive, adds a no-endorsement clause
  - Apache-2.0   permissive, adds an explicit patent grant
  - GPL-3.0      copyleft, derivative works must stay open

Note that extern/ contains third-party code under its own terms, which this
file does not override:

  - extern/brkga/  BRKGA framework by Rodrigo Franco Toso
  - extern/mtrand/ Mersenne Twister by Richard J. Wagner

Replace the whole of this file with the chosen license text.
